      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "FastAPI   \u00b7   apps/api   \u00b7   :8000\n\nGET /health                         GET /documents  \u00b7  POST /documents/ingest\nGET /rules  \u00b7  GET /rules/{id}      GET /rules/{id}/citation\nGET /review-queue                   POST /rules/{id}/approve  |  reject\n\nThin routes  \u2192  ankur_domain services.  DB down at boot \u2192 503, /health stays 200.",
      "originalText": "FastAPI   \u00b7   apps/api   \u00b7   :8000\n\nGET /health                         GET /documents  \u00b7  POST /documents/ingest\nGET /rules  \u00b7  GET /rules/{id}      GET /rules/{id}/citation\nGET /review-queue                   POST /rules/{id}/approve  |  reject\n\nThin routes  \u2192  ankur_domain services.  DB down at boot \u2192 503, /health stays 200.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
