      "updated": 1787563978632,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Core invariants  \u2014  never weaken these\n\n1.  No citation  \u2192  no approved rule\n     can_approve()  +  Postgres CHECK  (belt and braces)\n2.  Extraction never self-approves\n     initial_review_status()  only pending | needs_review\n3.  Null over guessed  \u2014  never invent crop, variety, seed rate, action, citation\n4.  Advisory-eligible  =  approved  AND  valid citation\n     (future trigger engine reads only this set)",
      "originalText": "Core invariants  \u2014  never weaken these\n\n1.  No citation  \u2192  no approved rule\n     can_approve()  +  Postgres CHECK  (belt and braces)\n2.  Extraction never self-approves\n     initial_review_status()  only pending | needs_review\n3.  Null over guessed  \u2014  never invent crop, variety, seed rate, action, citation\n4.  Advisory-eligible  =  approved  AND  valid citation\n     (future trigger engine reads only this set)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "el_761681",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
